                    </h1>

                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                        From wiring repairs to new installations, our certified electricians ensure safety and reliability for your home and office.
                        <br><span class="text-sm mt-3 block font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1 text-yellow-500"></i> Flat <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Rs. @SiteData.VisitCharge</span> visit charge (waived off on service).</span>
