                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center md:text-left">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-lg">30-Day Work Warranty</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">We offer a 30-day warranty on all electrical labor work.</p>
